            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Malayalam for a resident, then the Malayalam for a reception desk."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: വാടകയ്ക്കെടുക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വാടകയ്ക്കെടുക്കുക — vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka — \"to hire; to rent\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഞങ്ങൾ മൂന്ന് ദിവസത്തേക്ക് ഒരു കാർ വാടകയ്ക്കെടുത്തു. ñaṅṅaḷ mūnnŭ divasattēkkŭ oru kār vāṭakaykkeṭuttu. We hired a car for three days."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: വാടകയ്ക്കെടുത്തു, vāṭakaykkeṭuttu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally to take for rent: വാടകയ്ക്ക്, for rent, plus എടുക്കുക. To let out is വാടകയ്ക്ക് കൊടുക്കുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വാടകയ്ക്കെടുക്കുക (vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka) is a Malayalam compound built from വാടക, rent, from Sanskrit bhāṭaka, \"hire\" (Monier-Williams), and the native verb എടുക്കുക, to take (DEDR 851)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "ñaṅṅaḷ mūnnŭ divasattēkkŭ oru kār vāṭakaykkeṭuttu. — We hired a car for three days.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ñaṅṅaḷ mūnnŭ divasattēkkŭ oru kār vāṭakaykkeṭuttu.* — We hired a car for three days.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say the Malayalam for a resident, then the Malayalam for a reception desk, then say vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say the Malayalam for a resident, then the Malayalam for a reception desk, then say *vāṭakaykkeṭukkuka* again]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
