          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിക്ഷേപം — nikṣēpaṁ — \"a security deposit; a deposit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മുറിക്ക് ആയിരം രൂപ നിക്ഷേപം കൊടുക്കണം. muṟikkŭ āyiraṁ rūpa nikṣēpaṁ koṭukkaṇaṁ. You must pay a thousand rupees as a deposit for the room."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun of നിക്ഷേപിക്കുക, to deposit. In a bank it also means a savings deposit."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിക്ഷേപം (nikṣēpaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit nikṣepa, \"putting down\", and so a thing placed in trust (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
