          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഒഴിയുക — oḻiyuka — \"to vacate; to become empty\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "രാവിലെ പത്ത് മണിക്ക് മുൻപ് മുറി ഒഴിയണം. rāvile pattŭ maṇikkŭ munpŭ muṟi oḻiyaṇaṁ. You must vacate the room before ten in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ഒഴിഞ്ഞു, oḻiññu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The place takes no ending: മുറി ഒഴിയുക (oḻiyuka). An empty seat is an ഒഴിഞ്ഞ സീറ്റ്."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഒഴിയുക (oḻiyuka) is native Dravidian, \"to leave off, to be free of, to be empty\" (DEDR 1009). ഒഴിവ്, a vacancy, comes from the same root."
            }
          ]
        },
